{
  "$comment": "Lane 1 (plan 09 §5.1 items 3 and 7; §3.11): the calls this P1 Skill promises, in order, under EFF_TOOLSET=full, on fx-10h (Team 02; week 5; 14 regular-season weeks, six playoff teams over weeks 15–17). `season` runs under the configured reading (last season's seeds agree with it); `both_readings` on seeding-unknown passes seeding_mode both explicitly (ADV OBJ-13). Format: skills/README.md#tool-sequences.",
